"and it avoids \"414 URI too long\" with many facets or filters, but post "
"queries are not cached.With \"get\", requests always use \"get\" and fail "
"when too long. So keep \"post\" unless an HTTP cache layer requires pure "
"\"get\"."
msgstr ""
"Avec \"Get par défaut\", seuls les grandes requêtes utilisent \"Post\" "
"(limite de 1024 octets) et cela évite la réponse \"414 URI too long\" pour "
